WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
You cannot defeat us, you cannot slow us,

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.860
you cannot stop us, you cannot deter us.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.920
We will carry Charlie and Erica in our heart

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.600
every single day and fight that much harder

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.540
because of what you did to us.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.340
You have no idea the dragon you have awakened.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.400
You have no idea how determined we will be

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.160
to save this civilization, to save the West,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.100
to save this republic.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.040
Because our children are strong

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.360
and our grandchildren will be strong

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.520
and our children's children's children will be strong.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.680
And what will you leave behind?

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.000
Nothing, nothing.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.220
To our enemies, you have nothing to give,

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:48.000
you have nothing to offer, you have nothing to share.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.560
But bitterness, we have beauty, we have light,

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.080
we have goodness, we have determination,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.639
we have vision, we have strength.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:59.799
We built the world that we inhabit now.

00:00:59.799 --> 00:01:02.080
Generation by generation.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.360
And we will defend this world, we will defend goodness,

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.360
we will defend light, we will defend virtue.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.019
You cannot terrify us, you cannot frighten us,

00:01:12.019 --> 00:01:13.900
you cannot threaten us.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.919
Because we are on the side of goodness,

00:01:16.919 --> 00:01:18.680
we are on the side of God.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:22.300
And to my friend Charlie, to my brother Charlie,

00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:26.080
I know you are looking at us right now.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.400
I know you're watching Erica right now.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.440
I know you're watching your children right now.

